NOTICE ADVISORY TO NAVSTAR USERS (NANU) 2022002 NANU TYPE: GENERAL
*** GENERAL MESSAGE TO ALL GPS USERS ***
ON APPROXIMATELY 20 JAN 2022, SVN41 WILL RESUME TRANSMITTING L-BAND UTILIZING PRN22.

ON 20 JAN 2022, AFTER 2200Z, GPS WILL TRANSITION SVN41 (PRN22) INTO THE BROADCAST ALMANAC FOR ALL SATELLITES:
- THE ALMANAC TRANSITION, ACCOMPLISHED ONE SATELLITE AT A TIME, WILL REQUIRE APPROXIMATELY 24 HOURS TO COMPLETE
- BEFORE, DURING, AND AFTER TRANSITION SVN41 (PRN22) WILL REMAIN UNUSABLE UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE
- FUTURE NANUS WILL NOTIFY USERS OF ANY CHANGES TO THE ABOVE STATED STATUS
*** GENERAL MESSAGE TO ALL GPS USERS ***

